1. Retrieve products based on tags provided in a query.
2. Allow posting of new products with associated tags.

The application will use an SQLite database to store product data, and it should be able to handle HTTP GET and POST requests as defined in the OpenAPI schema. The GET request should return products that match any of the provided tags, and the POST request should allow adding new products with their tags.

