2. Create a database schema with tables for blog posts and categories/tags.
3. Implement a GET endpoint to retrieve blog posts based on categories/tags.
4. Implement a POST endpoint to add new blog posts with categories/tags.
5. Use Eloquent ORM to interact with the database and handle relationships between posts and categories/tags.

